{"unit_id":"bobowsh__dsh-llm-opencode#feature-sync","repo":"bobowsh/dsh-llm-opencode","commit":"4466df3ceeacd3bf756ea5f494725642d51b6ae5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-opencode 的功能「目录同步与缓存」：插件加载时后台同步免费模型成员和 models.dev 元数据，并将目录缓存到本机；网络失败时沿用缓存或内置目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:838-920","lib/index.js:942-988","lib/index.js:1163-1206"]}
